    "question_text": "In circle O, AB is a diameter, and point C\nlies on the circle. The tangent to the\ncircle at point C intersects the extension\nof line AB at point D. Segment AC is\ndrawn. If the angle between lines DC\nand DB is 50°, find the measure of BAC.",
