    "question_text": "Triangle ABC is drawn such that BAC = 90°. Point D lies on side AB, and point E lies on side AC. Segment DE is horizontal. The angle between line AB and line DE at point D,α is 130°. Find β,the angle between line DE and line EC at point E.",
