    "question_text": "To estimate the width of the Jing River, a target point P is selected on the opposite bank, and\npoints Q and S are taken near the bank such that P, Q, and S are in a straight line with PS\nperpendicular to the river. A point T is chosen on line a passing through S and perpendicular to\nPS. The intersection of PT and line b passing through Q and perpendicular to PS is R. If\nQS = 60.0 m, ST = 120.0 m, and QR = 80.0 m, what is the width of the river PQ?",
