    "question_text": "A trapezium ABCD has AB||CD. The right side BC has length\n10 cm. From vertex B, a perpendicular segment of length 6 cm\nis drawn to the line containing side AD (outside the\ntrapezium). The top side AB has length x. Determine the value\nof x.",
