    "question_text": "Find the distance between the two endpoints using the distance formula. The two endpoints of the line are (-3, 4) and (5, 2), respectively. Round to three decimal places.",
    "problem_index": 432,
    "model": "mistralai/mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct",
